OL,3,GNEWSAInquest hears rope unlikely tied
OL,4,Aby murdered boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA knot in a rope found at the scene
OL,7,Fwhere a 15-year-old boy's body was
OL,8,Fdiscovered in 1984 was unlikely to have
OL,9,Fbeen tied by himself, an inquest has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FMark Billington was last seen when he
OL,13,Frode his bike to fly a kite. His body
OL,14,Fwas found two months later hanging in a
OL,15,Ftree in woodland on the edge of
OL,16,FMeriden, near Coventry, nearly seven
OL,17,Fmiles (11km) from his house in Yardley
OL,18,Fin Birmingham.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
