OL,3,GNEWSAInquest hears rope unlikely tied
OL,4,Aby murdered boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice at the time treated his death as
OL,7,Fa suicide, however, it became a murder
OL,8,Finquiry in 2002. No-one has ever been
OL,9,Fcharged.
OL,11,FA pathologist told the court it was
OL,12,Funlikely that Mark would have been able
OL,13,Fto secure the knot himself.
